# Spanish lexicon: interjections and other words in o- (m-p author; ojalá by the a-c author). Own data, written clean-room.
oh           intj
ojalá        intj note=ojalá que llueva; ojalá + subjunctive
ojo          intj  note=¡ojo!: watch out
olé          intj  var=ole
ostras       intj  style=colloquial alt=vaya
